 ut a chord from near the edge is the most valuable observation of all.\nCl
 osest approach 04:31:35 WIB\, give or take 2 s. The star is 54° up in the
  N · dark sky.\nIt fades 4.7 magnitudes for up to 4.6 s on the centre lin
 e\, and the path is 37 km wide\, give or take 19 km.\nFinder chart\, the m
 ap and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroids-2026-11#2026-11
