 tar is 49° up in the SSE · dark sky.\nIt fades 3.6 magnitudes for up to 
 4.7 s on the centre line\, and the path is 56 km wide\, give or take 18 km
 .\nFinder chart\, the map and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/as
 teroids-2027-06#2027-06-03-1049-gotho-843392
